  "sourceTitle": "Hamburger - Vegetable Soup",
  "sourceText": "Hamburger - Vegetable Soup\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 11:28pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 qts. water\n1 onion, sliced\n2 celery stalks, diced (sticks)\n1 pound hamburger\n1 can onion soup\n1 (16 oz.) can tomato sauce\n1 (16 oz.) can tomatoes\n1 (16 oz.) can veg-all\n1 cup macaroni (Orzo)\nSalt and pepper\nGarlic salt to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Put all ingredients (except rice) in large pan. Bring to a boil and then simmer for 20 minutes. Add Orzo and cook 20 minutes more, stirring occasionally. Serves 6-8.",
